a painting I kept at a friend's place.

592
00:24:28,250 --> 00:24:29,970
It's by Zhao Hui,

593
00:24:29,970 --> 00:24:31,050
the famous artist.

594
00:24:30,570 --> 00:24:30,980
[Gathering of Fine Traits]

595
00:24:31,080 --> 00:24:32,560
It's worth 500,000 yuan.

596
00:24:32,600 --> 00:24:33,250
Take a look.

597
00:24:33,250 --> 00:24:34,530
You can take it.

598
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:37,170
I know about this painting.

599
00:24:37,560 --> 00:24:38,490
It's worthless.

600
00:24:38,560 --> 00:24:39,450
Just tell me,

601
00:24:39,690 --> 00:24:40,690
when will you transfer the money

602
00:24:40,690 --> 00:24:42,350
to the head office's account?

603
00:24:43,290 --> 00:24:43,690
Wait, you're the boss

604
00:24:43,690 --> 00:24:44,800
of a big company.

605
00:24:44,800 --> 00:24:47,130
Do you really need a few hundred thousand?

606
00:24:47,600 --> 00:24:48,210
What do you mean?

607
00:24:48,210 --> 00:24:49,930
Do I need a few hundred thousand?

608
00:24:49,930 --> 00:24:51,490
Don't you know if I lack money or not?

609
00:24:51,490 --> 00:24:52,120
It was you

610
00:24:52,120 --> 00:24:53,360
who secretly collected dirt on my loans

611
00:24:53,360 --> 00:24:54,120
and gave it to Chen Shan.

612
00:24:54,120 --> 00:24:54,730
Don't think I don't know

613
00:24:54,730 --> 00:24:55,800
that you did this!

614
00:24:55,800 --> 00:24:56,560
Listen, this isn't over!

615
00:24:56,560 --> 00:24:57,800
No, I don't even know where Chen Shan

616
00:24:57,800 --> 00:24:59,080
got those materials!

617
00:24:59,080 --> 00:24:59,770
I have no idea!

618
00:24:59,770 --> 00:25:00,760
Come on, stop lying.

619
00:25:00,760 --> 00:25:02,860
I don't know!

620
00:25:02,870 --> 00:25:03,870
You've been acting
like this for many years.

621
00:25:03,870 --> 00:25:05,400
Can you try a different act?

622
00:25:05,870 --> 00:25:07,110
I really don't know!

623
00:25:08,870 --> 00:25:09,660
Geng Jian...

624
00:25:11,180 --> 00:25:11,980
Look,

625
00:25:12,980 --> 00:25:13,910
when you go back,

626
00:25:14,220 --> 00:25:15,370
ask Chen Shan for it.

627
00:25:15,870 --> 00:25:16,730
Tell Chen Shan

628
00:25:16,830 --> 00:25:18,150
to sell the design
of the phase-two project

629
00:25:18,150 --> 00:25:18,910
to me

630
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:20,180
and withdraw from the bidding.

631
00:25:20,180 --> 00:25:21,180
And I'll transfer

632
00:25:21,310 --> 00:25:22,180
3 million yuan to your account.

633
00:25:22,180 --> 00:25:23,420
As for the money you owe me,

634
00:25:23,420 --> 00:25:24,460
I can give you

635
00:25:24,550 --> 00:25:25,420
more time.

636
00:25:32,700 --> 00:25:33,700
Here, Godfather.

637
00:25:34,290 --> 00:25:35,490
Have some warm water.

638
00:25:40,260 --> 00:25:41,780
You came to see me this late

639
00:25:41,810 --> 00:25:43,660
just to make me sell the project

640
00:25:43,900 --> 00:25:45,380
to Qi Mo for 3 million yuan?

641
00:25:45,530 --> 00:25:46,330
Yes.

642
00:25:47,130 --> 00:25:47,850
Let me

643
00:25:47,870 --> 00:25:49,350
analyze this for you.

644
00:25:49,350 --> 00:25:50,080
Well,

645
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:51,430
Project 713

646
00:25:51,430 --> 00:25:52,080
is indeed a great opportunity

647
00:25:52,080 --> 00:25:53,520
for us.

648
00:25:53,590 --> 00:25:55,760
But it has risks.

649
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,560
If anything happens,

650
00:25:57,560 --> 00:25:59,320
all your efforts will be in vain.

651
00:25:59,320 --> 00:26:00,480
We're a startup,

652
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:01,940
and we have a long way to go.

653
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:04,240
With this 3 million yuan as a foundation,

654
00:26:04,240 --> 00:26:06,500
what project can't you get in the future?

655
00:26:09,190 --> 00:26:11,240
Do you think it's possible, Godfather?

656
00:26:11,240 --> 00:26:12,430
We finally got this chance

657
00:26:12,430 --> 00:26:13,510
to go head-to-head

658
00:26:13,540 --> 00:26:14,870
with Qi Mo.

659
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,430
And we can finally

660
00:26:16,430 --> 00:26:17,670
avenge my father.

661
00:26:17,830 --> 00:26:18,590
If I sell

662
00:26:18,590 --> 00:26:19,800
this project now,

663
00:26:19,870 --> 00:26:21,800
our efforts will really be in vain.

664
00:26:23,320 --> 00:26:24,590
Think it through.

665
00:26:24,590 --> 00:26:25,590
Wait, Godfather.

666
00:26:25,830 --> 00:26:26,960
Just tell me.

667
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:29,130
What exactly happened?

668
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:30,320
Why did you suddenly ask me

669
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:31,520
to sell this project?

670
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:35,280
Qi Mo is forcing me to pay him back.

671
00:26:35,280 --> 00:26:36,000
What? He...

672
00:26:36,430 --> 00:26:37,670
When he accused you

673
00:26:37,670 --> 00:26:38,800
of embezzlement,

674
00:26:38,800 --> 00:26:39,800
I wanted to ask you.

675
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:40,590
What did you do

676
00:26:40,590 --> 00:26:42,450
with that a few hundred thousand?

677
00:26:44,280 --> 00:26:45,140
Stock trading.

678
00:26:46,190 --> 00:26:47,520
I-I lost it all.

679
00:26:59,190 --> 00:27:00,080
Okay, look,

680
00:27:00,080 --> 00:27:01,040
I'll go talk to

681
00:27:01,040 --> 00:27:02,150
Qi Mo.

682
00:27:02,280 --> 00:27:03,720
He'll definitely give you

683
00:27:03,720 --> 00:27:04,520
a year or more.

684
00:27:04,560 --> 00:27:05,430
Once this project is done,

685
00:27:05,430 --> 00:27:06,280
and the company has money,

686
00:27:06,280 --> 00:27:07,350
I'll help you solve it.

687
00:27:07,350 --> 00:27:08,670
I'm calling him now.

688
00:27:08,760 --> 00:27:09,480
Shan, Shan.

689
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:10,110
No.

690
00:27:10,110 --> 00:27:11,840
Don't call him. Don't call him.

691
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:14,520
Just tell me,

692
00:27:14,820 --> 00:27:17,080
can you sell it for 3 million yuan or not?

693
00:27:17,520 --> 00:27:18,320
I can.

694
00:27:18,860 --> 00:27:19,720
I'm the chairman,

695
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:20,870
and I definitely want to help you.

696
00:27:20,870 --> 00:27:22,240
That's my godson.

697
00:27:23,670 --> 00:27:25,110
But I also have to ask

698
00:27:25,110 --> 00:27:26,560
the board of directors.

699
00:27:26,560 --> 00:27:27,520
No need.

700
00:27:27,520 --> 00:27:28,760
The members of the board

701
00:27:28,760 --> 00:27:29,960
are all shareholders.

702
00:27:29,960 --> 00:27:31,040
Do you think they

703
00:27:31,280 --> 00:27:32,480
will agree?

704
00:27:32,630 --> 00:27:33,480
Let me count for you.

705
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:34,280
You know them.

706
00:27:34,590 --> 00:27:36,560
He Jianchuan, Sun Jie,

707
00:27:36,830 --> 00:27:37,590
those two from the hair salon...

708
00:27:37,590 --> 00:27:38,430
I know.

709
00:27:38,430 --> 00:27:39,630
I have an emergency.

710
00:27:39,630 --> 00:27:40,630
I have to go.

711
00:27:40,630 --> 00:27:41,630
I have to go.

712
00:27:48,280 --> 00:27:49,000
Xiaoyun.

713
00:27:50,720 --> 00:27:51,520
Godfather?

714
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:53,690
You wanted to see me?

715
00:27:54,080 --> 00:27:54,870
Sit.

716
00:28:02,910 --> 00:28:03,630
Godfather.

717
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:06,520
I know

718
00:28:06,520 --> 00:28:08,850
about the situation between you and Qi Mo,

719
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:10,350
and I know that Qi Mo

720
00:28:10,350 --> 00:28:12,390
has been pushing you hard lately.

721
00:28:13,040 --> 00:28:14,500
Aren't you short of money?

722
00:28:15,390 --> 00:28:16,430
I have money.

723
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:17,960
I can help you.

724
00:28:21,150 --> 00:28:21,910
Really?

725
00:28:23,590 --> 00:28:24,560
I was the one
who found out about your embezzlement

726
00:28:24,560 --> 00:28:26,520
and told Qi Mo.

727
00:28:27,520 --> 00:28:28,430
I-I know.

728
00:28:29,830 --> 00:28:31,490
You wouldn't blame me, right?

729
00:28:32,110 --> 00:28:32,870
I'm an accountant.

730
00:28:32,870 --> 00:28:34,320
It's my duty.

731
00:28:36,760 --> 00:28:37,800
But there's one thing

732
00:28:37,800 --> 00:28:39,040
I didn't tell him.

733
00:28:41,350 --> 00:28:42,350
Why did you transfer the money

734
00:28:42,350 --> 00:28:43,590
to Liu Hong?

735
00:28:47,280 --> 00:28:48,520
She and Wan Yang

736
00:28:48,960 --> 00:28:51,020
gave you a really hard time back then.

737
00:28:51,110 --> 00:28:52,910
Why would you give her money?

738
00:28:55,660 --> 00:28:56,740
Well...

739
00:28:59,760 --> 00:29:00,910
I hated Wan Yang.

740
00:29:03,560 --> 00:29:05,240
But his wife Liu Hong

741
00:29:05,270 --> 00:29:06,930
always came to me to complain.

742
00:29:08,760 --> 00:29:10,190
I was too soft-hearted.

743
00:29:10,830 --> 00:29:12,480
Seeing them as a widow and orphan,

744
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:13,800
I felt really sorry for them.

745
00:29:13,800 --> 00:29:15,460
It wasn't that simple, was it?

746
00:29:17,320 --> 00:29:17,800
Godfather,

747
00:29:17,800 --> 00:29:19,530
I really want to give you money,

748
00:29:20,710 --> 00:29:22,680
but you have to tell me the truth.

749
00:29:23,080 --> 00:29:24,080
If I don't know the reason,

750
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:25,080
how can I help you?

751
00:29:30,240 --> 00:29:31,040
One day,

752
00:29:31,590 --> 00:29:32,830
Liu Hong came to me,

753
00:29:32,830 --> 00:29:33,480
saying

754
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:35,410
her daughter was studying abroad,

755
00:29:35,630 --> 00:29:37,430
and she couldn't afford the tuition.

756
00:29:37,430 --> 00:29:38,630
I thought about it...

757
00:29:39,910 --> 00:29:41,000
Then I decided to give her money
for 2 months...

758
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:42,800
-2 months...
-Not just 2 months.

759
00:29:44,320 --> 00:29:46,050
You give her money every month.

760
00:29:49,390 --> 00:29:50,150
Godfather.

761
00:29:52,350 --> 00:29:53,670
Did Liu Hong

762
00:29:54,560 --> 00:29:56,390
blackmail you with something?

763
00:30:02,630 --> 00:30:03,430
Yes.

764
00:30:04,630 --> 00:30:05,430
You know,

765
00:30:06,110 --> 00:30:08,350
I've never

766
00:30:08,390 --> 00:30:09,520
been married,

767
00:30:10,830 --> 00:30:12,360
and I get lonely sometimes.

768
00:30:15,350 --> 00:30:17,210
Once, I couldn't control myself,

769
00:30:17,390 --> 00:30:18,830
and she got a hold on me.

770
00:30:20,350 --> 00:30:22,280
Then I kept transferring money to her

771
00:30:22,280 --> 00:30:23,430
every month.

772
00:30:26,040 --> 00:30:27,840
One mistake ruined everything.

773
00:30:30,830 --> 00:30:33,110
I really regret it.

774
00:30:33,910 --> 00:30:35,770
My lifelong reputation is ruined

775
00:30:36,320 --> 00:30:37,430
because of her.

776
00:30:50,830 --> 00:30:52,090
I'm telling the truth.

777
00:30:53,350 --> 00:30:55,080
Since you won't tell the truth,

778
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:56,760
I won't force you.

779
00:30:58,630 --> 00:30:59,630
As for the money,

780
00:31:01,150 --> 00:31:03,680
you'll have to find a way
to solve it yourself.

781
00:31:04,150 --> 00:31:05,010
It's the truth.

782
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,830
I'm telling the truth.

783
00:31:12,870 --> 00:31:13,480
I...

784
00:31:25,240 --> 00:31:26,440
Geng Jian won't talk.

785
00:31:27,080 --> 00:31:28,410
Let's stick to the plan.

786
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:46,760
Sun Jie, what are you going to do?

787
00:31:47,080 --> 00:31:49,240
Wan was your benefactor!

788
00:31:49,240 --> 00:31:51,780
Whoever pays me is my benefactor.

789
00:31:52,120 --> 00:31:53,520
Geng Jian paid me 200,000 yuan

790
00:31:53,520 --> 00:31:54,980
to take your life.

791
00:32:00,320 --> 00:32:01,830
You're too greedy.

792
00:32:02,910 --> 00:32:03,870
He gives you 15,000 yuan a month.

793
00:32:03,870 --> 00:32:05,280
How can you still think it's not enough?

794
00:32:05,280 --> 00:32:07,240
You pushed him to a dead end.

795
00:32:08,150 --> 00:32:09,750
That's why he wants you dead.

796
00:32:10,670 --> 00:32:12,180
I won't let you off easy.

797
00:32:13,080 --> 00:32:14,010
Three years ago,

798
00:32:15,350 --> 00:32:16,800
you forged orders

799
00:32:16,910 --> 00:32:18,520
with your useless brother

800
00:32:18,520 --> 00:32:20,000
and got me into prison.

801
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:21,390
I served 3 years in jail.

802
00:32:22,390 --> 00:32:23,390
So today,

803
00:32:23,430 --> 00:32:25,760
we'll settle old and new scores together.

804
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:27,910
I won't go easy on you.

805
00:32:30,800 --> 00:32:33,190
The hotpot restaurant
won't open tomorrow at noon.

806
00:32:33,190 --> 00:32:34,830
They'll come at 4:30 PM.

807
00:32:35,350 --> 00:32:36,240
I did the math.

808
00:32:36,350 --> 00:32:37,560
15 hours

809
00:32:38,870 --> 00:32:40,720
is enough to freeze you to death.

810
00:32:59,320 --> 00:33:00,850
Chen Shan, why are you here?

811
00:33:01,800 --> 00:33:02,760
Are you crazy?

812
00:33:02,820 --> 00:33:03,800
What are you doing, Chen Shan?

813
00:33:03,800 --> 00:33:04,560
What are you doing?

814
00:33:04,560 --> 00:33:05,330
Chen Shan!

815
00:33:05,910 --> 00:33:06,760
Jie.

816
00:33:08,190 --> 00:33:09,480
This is murder!

817
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,240
I don't care!

818
00:33:10,760 --> 00:33:12,190
I know you hate Wan Yang.

819
00:33:12,280 --> 00:33:13,000
I hate him too.

820
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:14,280
I wish I could kill him!

821
00:33:14,910 --> 00:33:16,350
You know how he treated

822
00:33:16,380 --> 00:33:17,580
my parents back then.

823
00:33:18,190 --> 00:33:19,480
But you can't do this.

824
00:33:20,110 --> 00:33:20,910
Jie.

825
00:33:21,280 --> 00:33:22,630
You just got out.

826
00:33:22,800 --> 00:33:24,000
Do you really want to

827
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:25,350
go to jail again for this?

828
00:33:25,350 --> 00:33:26,520
I don't care.

829
00:33:27,150 --> 00:33:28,830
Geng Jian gave me money.

830
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:29,760
Will you pay me

831
00:33:29,760 --> 00:33:30,590
to stop doing this?

832
00:33:30,590 --> 00:33:32,270
This isn't about money.

833
00:33:32,290 --> 00:33:32,910
Jie.

834
00:33:33,670 --> 00:33:34,530
Think about it.

835
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:36,430
If you really kill her,

836
00:33:36,480 --> 00:33:37,460
you'll be doomed,

837
00:33:37,460 --> 00:33:38,860
and so will my godfather!

838
00:33:39,000 --> 00:33:40,390
Is Liu Hong

839
00:33:40,390 --> 00:33:41,190
really worth it?

840
00:33:41,190 --> 00:33:42,830
Who cares about a woman like her?

841
00:33:42,830 --> 00:33:44,190
Even her own brother
doesn't care about her.

842
00:33:44,190 --> 00:33:45,000
If none of us tell anyone,

843
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:45,800
who will know?

844
00:33:46,240 --> 00:33:47,000
Oh, right.

845
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:48,460
She has a daughter abroad.

846
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:50,560
If I get a chance to go abroad

847
00:33:50,560 --> 00:33:51,240
one day,

848
00:33:51,240 --> 00:33:51,830
I'll take

849
00:33:51,830 --> 00:33:52,830
her daughter's life too!

850
00:33:52,830 --> 00:33:54,240
I'll end it all!

851
00:33:56,760 --> 00:33:57,560
Fine.

852
00:33:57,760 --> 00:33:58,630
Do whatever you want!

853
00:33:58,630 --> 00:34:00,030
This is out of my control!

854
00:34:02,320 --> 00:34:03,320
But before that,

855
00:34:03,910 --> 00:34:04,630
can you let me

856
00:34:04,630 --> 00:34:05,960
ask her a few questions?

857
00:34:07,800 --> 00:34:08,630
I just want to talk,

858
00:34:08,630 --> 00:34:09,440
okay?

859
00:34:11,480 --> 00:34:13,230
Fine, hurry up!

860
00:34:16,190 --> 00:34:17,310
Save me! I'm begging you!

861
00:34:17,310 --> 00:34:17,960
Be quiet!

862
00:34:17,960 --> 00:34:19,820
I have money. I can give you money!

863
00:34:21,840 --> 00:34:23,230
Liu Jun already told me

864
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:24,750
that you have

865
00:34:24,750 --> 00:34:26,190
something on my godfather,

866
00:34:26,190 --> 00:34:27,960
and it's related to my family.

867
00:34:31,310 --> 00:34:32,080
You can see

868
00:34:32,080 --> 00:34:33,139
the situation now.

869
00:34:33,750 --> 00:34:35,710
Tell me what you know,

870
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:38,520
and maybe I can save you.

871
00:34:49,360 --> 00:34:50,260
Geng Jian...

872
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:51,690
He...

873
00:34:52,590 --> 00:34:53,320
He killed...

874
00:34:56,630 --> 00:34:58,030
H-He killed your mother.

875
00:34:58,480 --> 00:34:59,740
He killed your mother!

876
00:35:01,920 --> 00:35:03,960
Before Wan Yang died, he recorded

877
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:05,920
how Geng Jian killed your mother.

878
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:08,300
It's evidence of your mother's murder.

879
00:35:08,330 --> 00:35:10,700
I-I have it.

880
00:35:14,840 --> 00:35:15,640
Director Wan,

881
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:18,520
why did you want to see me?

882
00:35:19,710 --> 00:35:21,720
How does it feel to be the top leader?

883
00:35:21,770 --> 00:35:22,250
Come on.

884
00:35:23,790 --> 00:35:24,920
It's all for work.

885
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:27,440
I smell cigars.

886
00:35:28,920 --> 00:35:29,920
I didn't smoke it.

887
00:35:30,310 --> 00:35:32,080
The smell was too strong.
I couldn't stand it.

888
00:35:32,080 --> 00:35:33,080
I figured so.

889
00:35:34,150 --> 00:35:35,270
But you'll smoke

890
00:35:35,270 --> 00:35:36,800
a second puff, then a third,

891
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:39,670
forcing yourself to like it.

892
00:35:39,670 --> 00:35:40,880
Then slowly,

893
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:42,630
you'll get used to it.

894
00:35:43,710 --> 00:35:44,680
D-Did you call me here

895
00:35:44,680 --> 00:35:45,960
just for this?

896
00:35:46,440 --> 00:35:48,170
I want you to see this teahouse.

897
00:35:49,110 --> 00:35:51,060
Every day at 5:15 PM,

898
00:35:51,360 --> 00:35:53,750
it's the best time to watch the sunset.

899
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:56,520
Mr. Zhao at the teahouse

900
00:35:56,520 --> 00:35:57,880
can make

901
00:35:58,150 --> 00:35:59,750
the best tea.

902
00:36:00,560 --> 00:36:02,510
I already brewed

903
00:36:03,560 --> 00:36:04,400
some tea for you just now

904
00:36:04,400 --> 00:36:06,270
with that antique purple clay teapot.

905
00:36:06,270 --> 00:36:07,480
You can try it later.

906
00:36:08,150 --> 00:36:09,790
Every year when the new tea arrives,

907
00:36:09,790 --> 00:36:11,040
as long as you're here,

908
00:36:11,040 --> 00:36:12,670
I'll let you smell it

909
00:36:13,560 --> 00:36:15,690
so you can remember the taste of power.

910
00:36:17,840 --> 00:36:19,400
Well, I think that

911
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:20,920
power is meant

912
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:23,050
to benefit all the workers in the plant

913
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:25,560
instead of making profits for oneself.

914
00:36:25,920 --> 00:36:27,110
Those old and corrupt things

915
00:36:27,110 --> 00:36:27,920
are outdated.

916
00:36:28,920 --> 00:36:29,750
Director Wan,

917
00:36:30,080 --> 00:36:31,230
I won't drink here.

918
00:36:31,230 --> 00:36:32,290
Drink it yourself.

919
00:36:32,630 --> 00:36:33,440
I'm leaving.

920
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:35,920
"I'd rather give up the empire

921
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:37,360
for a beauty."

922
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:40,300
You said that, didn't you?

923
00:36:50,230 --> 00:36:51,080
Don't use that nonsense

924
00:36:51,080 --> 00:36:52,440
to threaten me anymore.

925
00:36:52,520 --> 00:36:53,520
We are different.

926
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:55,360
I can change.

927
00:36:55,360 --> 00:36:56,110
I'll lead all the workers in the plant

928
00:36:56,110 --> 00:36:57,440
towards a bright path

929
00:36:57,970 --> 00:36:59,830
and eliminate unhealthy trends!

930
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:02,230
Well, this is the funniest joke

931
00:37:02,230 --> 00:37:04,440
I've ever heard.

932
00:37:05,560 --> 00:37:06,480
Geng Jian,

933
00:37:06,520 --> 00:37:08,040
you've been acting so long

934
00:37:08,040 --> 00:37:09,080
that you're used to it

935
00:37:09,080 --> 00:37:10,840
and even believe it yourself.

936
00:37:12,470 --> 00:37:14,400
Isn't it funny

937
00:37:15,040 --> 00:37:16,480
for a murderer

938
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:18,670
to say this nonsense?

939
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:32,040
Yes, that look.

940
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:34,040
Back when you were
arrested for prostitution

941
00:37:34,040 --> 00:37:35,570
and asked me to bail you out,

942
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:38,560
you had the same look.

943
00:37:39,230 --> 00:37:40,150
That day, right after

944
00:37:40,150 --> 00:37:42,150
I asked you to talk to Zhang Wenying,

945
00:37:42,270 --> 00:37:43,790
she died.

946
00:37:44,670 --> 00:37:46,270
Is there such a coincidence?

947
00:37:46,790 --> 00:37:48,390
I didn't even go to her place.

948
00:37:49,480 --> 00:37:50,750
I didn't agree to go.

949
00:37:54,310 --> 00:37:55,960
You forced her to her death!

950
00:37:58,360 --> 00:37:59,270
To be honest,

951
00:38:00,190 --> 00:38:02,450
when I asked you to talk to Zhang Wenying,

952
00:38:03,190 --> 00:38:04,560
I was worried.

953
00:38:05,750 --> 00:38:07,150
So, I stayed downstairs.

954
00:38:07,230 --> 00:38:09,040
You went upstairs at 8:40 PM,

955
00:38:09,080 --> 00:38:10,340
stayed for 15 minutes,

956
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:12,080
and came down in a panic.

957
00:38:12,270 --> 00:38:14,400
Then you hurriedly ran back up again.

958
00:38:14,550 --> 00:38:17,060
[Staff Certificate]

959
00:38:15,370 --> 00:38:16,760
You dropped something.

960
00:38:22,620 --> 00:38:23,260
[Staff Certificate]

961
00:38:24,270 --> 00:38:26,060
[Staff Certificate]

962
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:29,750
I didn't go.

963
00:38:33,080 --> 00:38:34,400
Deny it as you want.

964
00:38:35,230 --> 00:38:36,920
Let's go to the police station.

965
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:38,080
They are the experts.

966
00:38:38,080 --> 00:38:39,750
We'll let them analyze it.

967
00:38:40,040 --> 00:38:41,590
I made a lot of mistakes.

968
00:38:41,710 --> 00:38:43,440
I might be sentenced to 7 or 9 years

969
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:44,590
in prison.

970
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:46,000
But murder

971
00:38:46,630 --> 00:38:48,030
means the death penalty.

972
00:38:48,710 --> 00:38:49,520
Let's go.

973
00:38:49,710 --> 00:38:51,280
W-What are you doing?

974
00:38:51,860 --> 00:38:52,710
Scared?

975
00:38:55,400 --> 00:38:56,120
Let's go.

976
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:58,920
What do you want?

977
00:38:59,230 --> 00:39:00,190
Tell me,

978
00:39:01,080 --> 00:39:02,790
did you kill her?

979
00:39:11,840 --> 00:39:12,440
No.

980
00:39:14,520 --> 00:39:15,790
Really?

981
00:39:19,230 --> 00:39:20,080
No.

982
00:39:22,590 --> 00:39:23,400
You...

983
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:28,310
Didn't you ask me

984
00:39:28,670 --> 00:39:29,840
to talk to her?

985
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:30,590
Senior.

986
00:39:31,080 --> 00:39:32,110
Could you please

987
00:39:33,080 --> 00:39:34,400
calm down?

988
00:39:35,670 --> 00:39:36,840
Don't turn yourself in.

989
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:38,670
I told her, "Don't turn yourself in.

990
00:39:38,670 --> 00:39:40,600
That wouldn't be good for anyone."

991
00:39:41,790 --> 00:39:42,790
Then she got mad.

992
00:39:42,790 --> 00:39:44,440
She was furious.

993
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:45,980
You're such a coward!

994
00:39:46,040 --> 00:39:47,590
She called me a coward.

995
00:39:47,630 --> 00:39:49,540
She scolded me.

996
00:39:49,570 --> 00:39:51,130
So timid.

997
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:53,610
You'll always be a loser.

998
00:39:53,630 --> 00:39:54,670
She said, "You're like a eunuch"...

999
00:39:54,670 --> 00:39:55,560
You're like a eunuch,

1000
00:39:55,560 --> 00:39:56,360
always serving others!

1001
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:57,630
"Always serving others.

1002
00:39:57,630 --> 00:39:59,040
You'll always be a loser."

1003
00:39:59,040 --> 00:39:59,710
You'll never be

1004
00:39:59,710 --> 00:40:00,960
the plant director!

1005
00:40:00,960 --> 00:40:02,080
"You'll never be the boss!"

1006
00:40:02,080 --> 00:40:03,710
I've never looked up to you!

1007
00:40:03,710 --> 00:40:05,310
You make me sick!

1008
00:40:05,310 --> 00:40:06,050
She insulted me...

1009
00:40:06,050 --> 00:40:07,440
Go! Go!

1010
00:40:07,840 --> 00:40:09,520
Then I took a rope

1011
00:40:09,520 --> 00:40:11,520
and... put it around her neck.

1012
00:40:11,520 --> 00:40:12,000
I...

1013
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:14,710
I treated your family so well,

1014
00:40:14,710 --> 00:40:16,190
and all I get is this

1015
00:40:16,210 --> 00:40:17,230
"eunuch"!

1016
00:40:17,360 --> 00:40:18,360
No respect,

1017
00:40:18,360 --> 00:40:20,230
no value at all?

1018
00:40:20,260 --> 00:40:22,360
Why is everyone humiliating me?

1019
00:40:22,360 --> 00:40:23,480
No respect!

1020
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:25,190
You must apologize!

1021
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:28,080
Apologize! Apologize!

1022
00:40:29,670 --> 00:40:31,480
"Apologize to me..."

1023
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:34,480
You used too much strength

1024
00:40:35,920 --> 00:40:37,450
and strangled her to death.

1025
00:40:55,520 --> 00:40:57,490
What do you want?

1026
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:00,790
Geng Jian.

1027
00:41:02,270 --> 00:41:03,880
I want to ask you for a favor.

1028
00:41:04,840 --> 00:41:06,770
If something really happens to me,

1029
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:07,710
can you take good care of

1030
00:41:07,710 --> 00:41:09,150
my family?

1031
00:41:09,190 --> 00:41:10,250
I-I can.

1032
00:41:10,520 --> 00:41:11,400
I-I can.

1033
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:13,080
I like people who keep their word.

1034
00:41:13,080 --> 00:41:13,480
I am.

1035
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:15,150
I-I am a man of my word.

1036
00:41:18,040 --> 00:41:19,080
It's a deal then.

1037
00:41:19,560 --> 00:41:20,360
Okay.

1038
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:22,360
Okay...
